sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant I as Interaction Layer
  participant O as Agent Orchestrator
  participant D as Decomposition Engine
  participant K as Knowledge Retrieval
  participant E as Effort Estimator
  participant S as Constraint Scheduler
  participant V as Feasibility Evaluator
  participant F as Feedback Analyzer
  participant R as Revision Engine
  participant M as Memory Store

  U->>I: Submit goal and constraints
  I->>O: Start plan request
  O->>D: Build learning units and milestones
  D-->>O: Unit graph and dependencies
  O->>K: Retrieve curated resources and topic structures
  K-->>O: Ranked resources
  O->>E: Estimate effort per unit
  E-->>O: Hour estimates and confidence
  O->>S: Build day-wise schedule
  S-->>O: Plan v1 and alternatives
  O->>V: Evaluate feasibility
  V-->>O: Feasibility score and warnings
  O->>M: Persist plan v1 context
  O-->>I: Return recommended plan
  I-->>U: Show plan

  U->>I: Provide feedback and progress
  I->>O: Trigger adaptation
  O->>F: Classify feedback and detect impact
  F-->>O: Affected units and severity
  O->>R: Revise remaining plan only
  R->>S: Re-optimize under new constraints
  S-->>R: Revised schedule candidate
  R->>V: Re-evaluate revised plan
  V-->>R: Feasibility and risk
  R-->>O: Plan v2 plus change summary
  O->>M: Persist revision history
  O-->>I: Deliver updated plan
  I-->>U: Show what changed and why
